Subject: M2B Windows Platform Preflight Runtime Requirement Matrix

& [MatrixIdentity] is requirement control
  + [runtime_profile] is cantor-windows-platform-preflight-runtime/0.1
  + [state] is physical_expectation_disproven_signature_invalidated

& [M2B-WPR-001] lineage is satisfied by source and prior proof bindings
& [M2B-WPR-002] isolated crate is verified
& [M2B-WPR-003] pre-effect request validation is verified
& [M2B-WPR-004] non-Windows unsupported source path is verified and cross-target compile remains pending
& [M2B-WPR-005] exact read-only open policy is statically verified
& [M2B-WPR-006] single valid ownership transfer is statically verified
& [M2B-WPR-007] same-handle ordered query set is statically verified
& [M2B-WPR-008] exact aligned bounded outputs are statically and unit verified
& [M2B-WPR-009] immediate nonzero OS error provenance is statically verified
& [M2B-WPR-010] local fault mapping is unit verified
& [M2B-WPR-011] complete owned result mapping is implementation complete
& [M2B-WPR-012] six-block isolated unsafe budget is verified
& [M2B-WPR-013] forbidden resource and effect surface is statically verified
& [M2B-WPR-014] pure and static tests are verified in debug and release
& [M2B-WPR-015] ignored exact-root probe executed and returned a valid unexpected QueryFault
& [M2B-WPR-016] blocked physical evidence is bound by SHA-256
& [M2B-WPR-017] global closure is pending
& [M2B-WPR-018] scanner and receipt absence is verified

& [PhysicalClaims] are closed
  + [permitted_if_observed] exact current-host root preflight request and result only
  + [forbidden] traversal, content, stream, candidate, scanner, receipt, launch, seal, or promotion
  + [actual] RemoteProtocolInformation QueryFault error 87
  + [expected_complete] is failed
  + [signature_uuid] is invalidated
